'''''Dryopteris dilatata''''', the '''broad buckler-fern''',<ref name=BSBI07>{{BSBI 2007 |access-date=2014-10-17 }}</ref> is a robust [[species]] of [[deciduous]] or semi[[evergreen]] [[fern]] in the [[Family (taxonomy)|family]] [[Dryopteridaceae]], [[native plant|native]] to Europe, particularly western and central Europe. In southern Europe, it is mostly found in mountainous regions. It is also found between the [[Black Sea]] and the [[Caspian Sea]].<ref name="RünkZobeZobe12">{{Citation |last=Rünk |first=Kai |last2=Zobel |first2=Martin |last3=Zobel |first3=Kristjan |year=2012 |title=Biological Flora of the British Isles: ''Dryopteris carthusiana'', ''D. dilatata'' and ''D. expansa'' |journal=Journal of Ecology |volume=100 |issue=4 |pages=1039–1063 |doi=10.1111/j.1365-2745.2012.01985.x |name-list-style=amp |doi-access=free }}</ref> It grows to {{convert|90|cm|0|abbr=on}} tall by {{convert|120|cm|0|abbr=on}} wide, with dark green tripinnate fronds, the ribs covered in brown scales.<ref name=RHSAZ>{{cite book|title=RHS A-Z encyclopedia of garden plants|year=2008|publisher=Dorling Kindersley|location=United Kingdom|isbn=1405332964|pages=1136}}</ref><ref>{{cite web|title=Dryopteris dilatata|url=http://www.naturespot.org.uk/species/broad-buckler-fern|publisher=NatureSpot|access-date=13 July 2013}}</ref>

The Latin [[binomial nomenclature|specific epithet]] ''dilatata'' means "spread out".<ref name=RHSLG>{{cite book |last=Harrison |first=Lorraine |title=RHS Latin for Gardeners |year=2012 |publisher=Mitchell Beazley |location=United Kingdom |isbn=184533731X }}</ref>

The species<ref>{{cite web|title=RHS Plant Selector - ''Dryopteris dilatata''|url=
https://www.rhs.org.uk/Plants/6182/Dryopteris-dilatata/Details | access-date = 3 June 2020}}</ref> and the [[cultivar]]s 'Crispa Whiteside'<ref>{{cite web|title=RHS Plant Selector - ''Dryopteris dilatata'' 'Crispa Whiteside'|url=https://www.rhs.org.uk/Plants/65855/Dryopteris-dilatata-Crispa-Whiteside/Details | access-date = 3 June 2020}}</ref> and 'Lepidota Cristata'<ref>{{cite web | url= https://www.rhs.org.uk/Plants/73733/Dryopteris-dilatata-Lepidota-Cristata/Details 
| title = RHS Plantfinder - ''Dryopteris dilatata'' ‘Lepidota Cristata’
| access-date = 12 February 2018}}</ref>
have gained the [[Royal Horticultural Society]]'s [[Award of Garden Merit]].<ref>{{cite web  | url= https://www.rhs.org.uk/plants/pdfs/agm-lists/agm-ornamentals.pdf | title = AGM Plants - Ornamental | date = July 2017 | page = 34 | publisher = Royal Horticultural Society | access-date = 6 February 2018}}</ref>

